### Variabel Dasar
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Ambil Semua Foto Galeri (GET /api/v1/gallery)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gallery HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Ambil Foto Galeri dengan Filter Kategori dan Paginasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gallery?category=remaja&page=1&limit=6 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Unggah Foto Kegiatan Baru (POST /api/v1/gallery/upload)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gallery/upload HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Kerja Bakti Saluran Irigasi Sawah
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

Warga bergotong royong membersihkan saluran irigasi bersama pemuda.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

gotong_royong
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="uploader_name"

Pak Hartono
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="activity_date"

2026-10-15
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="dummy.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./database/seed.sql
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### 4. Ambil Detail Foto Galeri Berdasarkan ID (GET /api/v1/gallery/:id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gallery/e4b2d308-4171-4b1f-827c-3b91a0fc1290 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
